  m_text: During an experimental growth serum test for secret project, he accidentally
    absorbed ten times the dose making him bigger, stronger, and slower than any
    bean before him. His oversized eyes reflect both wonder and regret, as the experiment
    went wrong and sealed him inside a chamber meant for study.
